  "problem": "Find the inverse of the matrix\n$C=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].$\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n  <tbody>\n    \n    <tr height=\"35px\">\n      <td rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\">\n        ${C}^{-1}=\\,\\,$\n      </td>\n      \n      <td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n      \n      \n      <td width=\"40px\" align=\"center\">\n        $1$\n      </td>\n      <td width=\"40px\" align=\"center\">\n       $0$\n      </td>\n      <td width=\"40px\" align=\"center\">\n         {{field-1}}\n      </td>\n      <td width=\"40px\" align=\"center\">\n       $0$\n      </td>\n      \n      \n      <td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    \n    <tr height=\"35px\">\n      \n      <td align=\"center\"></td>\n      \n      \n      <td align=\"center\">\n       $0$\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        $0$\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        {{field-2}}\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        $0$\n      </td>\n      \n      \n      <td align=\"center\"></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    \n    <tr height=\"35px\">\n      \n      <td align=\"center\"></td>\n      \n      \n      <td align=\"center\">\n        {{field-3}}      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        {{field-4}}\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        $0$\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        $0$\n      </td>\n      \n      \n      <td align=\"center\"></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    \n    <tr height=\"35px\">\n      \n      <td align=\"center\"></td>\n      \n      \n      <td align=\"center\">\n       $0$\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        $0$\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        $0$\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n      \n      \n      <td align=\"center\"></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
